{"title":"Install the desktop app","description":"Download and install Stirling PDF Desktop on Windows, macOS or Linux, including winget, Scoop, Homebrew and AUR, and what happens on first launch.","unlisted":false,"space":"desktop","layout":"","article":"<a class=\"doc-space\" data-accent=\"desktop\" href=\"/Desktop/\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 21h8M12 17v4\"/></svg><span>Desktop app</span></a>\n    <h1>Install the desktop app</h1>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-group=\"os\" data-sync=\"true\" id=\"tabs-0\"><div class=\"tab-list\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-value=\"windows\" aria-selected=\"true\">Windows</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"macos\" aria-selected=\"false\">macOS</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"linux\" aria-selected=\"false\">Linux</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel active\" data-value=\"windows\">\n<p>Requires Windows 10 or 11.</p>\n<p><strong>Installer (x64)</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download <a href=\"https://files.stirlingpdf.com/win-installer.exe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stirling-PDF-windows-x86_64.msi</a>.</li>\n<li>Run it and approve the administrator prompt. It installs for all users.</li>\n<li>Open <strong>Stirling PDF</strong> from the Start menu.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>winget (x64)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">powershell</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">winget install StirlingTools.StirlingPDF</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>Scoop (x64)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">powershell</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scoop bucket add stirling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pdf https:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">github.com</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Stirling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Tools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">homebrew</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stirling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pdf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scoop install stirling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pdf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stirling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pdf</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Update with <code>scoop update stirling-pdf</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Windows on ARM</strong></p>\n<p>Download <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/releases/latest/download/Stirling-PDF-windows-arm64-setup.exe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stirling-PDF-windows-arm64-setup.exe</a> and run it. The ARM build isn't on winget.</p>\n<p>If the app runs but no window appears, install the <a href=\"https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/webview2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime</a> and start it again.</p>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"macos\">\n<p>Requires macOS 10.15 or later, on Apple silicon or Intel.</p>\n<p><strong>DMG</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download <a href=\"https://files.stirlingpdf.com/mac-installer.dmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stirling PDF for Mac</a>.</li>\n<li>Open the DMG and drag <strong>Stirling PDF</strong> into <strong>Applications</strong>.</li>\n<li>Open <strong>Stirling PDF</strong> from Applications.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>If macOS blocks the app, open <strong>System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security</strong>, select <strong>Open Anyway</strong> next to the Stirling PDF message, then open it again.</p>\n<p><strong>Homebrew</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tap</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-tools/stirling-pdf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cask</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"linux\">\n<p>Requires a 64-bit x86 (x86_64) system.</p>\n<p><strong>Debian and Ubuntu (.deb)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wget</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://files.stirlingpdf.com/linux-installer.deb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./linux-installer.deb</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>Fedora and RHEL (.rpm)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wget</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://files.stirlingpdf.com/linux-installer.rpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dnf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./linux-installer.rpm</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>AppImage</strong> (no install needed)</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wget</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://files.stirlingpdf.com/linux-installer.AppImage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chmod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +x</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> linux-installer.AppImage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./linux-installer.AppImage</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>Arch Linux (AUR)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">paru</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf-desktop</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n<h2 id=\"first-launch\" class=\"anchor-heading\">First launch<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#first-launch\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>On an unmanaged installation, <strong>Sign in to Stirling</strong> gives three choices:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sign in to use <a href=\"/Desktop/Connection-Modes/#sign-in-to-stirling-cloud\">Stirling Cloud</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>or connect to a self-hosted account</strong> to use <a href=\"/Desktop/Connection-Modes/#connect-to-a-self-hosted-server\">your organisation's server</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Continue without signing in</strong> to work in Local Only mode.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can change this later in <strong>Settings → Connection Mode</strong>. If a tool says <strong>Backend starting up...</strong>, wait a few seconds.</p>\n<p><a id=\"automated-installation-msi-installer\"></a>Administrators can require sign-in, restrict accounts to Stirling Cloud, and keep document processing local. For silent installation and these policies, see <a href=\"/Desktop/Managed-Deployment/#windows-intune-sccm-group-policy\">Managed deployment</a>.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Desktop/Install.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"<div class=\"toc-title\">On this page</div><ul><li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#first-launch\">First launch</a></li></ul>","pager":"<a class=\"pager-link pager-prev\" href=\"/Desktop/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">&larr; Previous</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Overview</span>\n      </a><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/Desktop/Connection-Modes/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Connection modes</span>\n      </a>"}